<title>CHINA: Shanghai Tyre falls on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Tyre falls on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign currency B shares in Shanghai Tyre and Rubber Co have fallen sharply in the past two days due to profit-taking after speculation had earlier pushed its share price too high, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The shares fell 17.8 percent over the Tuesday and Wednesday sessions to end at $0.472 at Wednesday's close.</p>
<p>There were also market expectations that prices of the firm's raw materials might increase this year, traders said.</p>
